#
# Canonical list of 3Dconnexion SpaceMouse product ids that enumerate under
# Logitech's vendor id (0x046d) — the classic pucks predate 3Dconnexion's own
# 0x256f vendor id. This is the SINGLE SOURCE for that list. Two consumers read
# it, neither hard-codes its own copy:
#
#   * the C daemon's LED backend — scripts/gen-pids-header.sh turns this file
#     into src/daemon's generated spacemouse_046d_pids.h at build time
#     (see CMakeLists.txt); led_linux.c matches HID_ID uevent strings.
#   * the installer — scripts/install.sh reads this file into the udev
#     ATTRS{idProduct} alternation for both the hidraw rule (LED) and the
#     input rule (evdev read access, #11).
#
# 0x256f is 3Dconnexion's own, exclusive vendor id and is matched vendor-wide
# on each side (not per-PID), so it does NOT belong here — only 046d PIDs do.
#
# Format: one lowercase PID per line, model name after. '#' starts a comment.
# Matching 046d by these exact PIDs (never the bare vendor) keeps the rules and
# the LED writes off unrelated Logitech mice, keyboards and webcams.

c603  SpaceTraveler
c605  CadMan
c606  SpaceMouse Classic
c621  SpaceBall 5000
c623  SpaceTraveler / SpaceNavigator NB
c625  SpacePilot
c626  SpaceNavigator
c627  SpaceExplorer
c628  SpaceNavigator NB
c629  SpacePilot Pro
c62b  SpaceMouse Pro
c62e  SpaceMouse Wireless
c640  SpaceMouse Wireless Receiver
